    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "msgctxt": "498548",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't hate anyone.\nI'll endure any abuse.\nSo, if you could―――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "msgctxt": "499116",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "………………………tch.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "msgctxt": "499864",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ahh, but―――\nbut, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF was different.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "msgctxt": "500300",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My gentle, gentle prince.\nNow my love has become the real thing.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "msgctxt": "500428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF is my everything.\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF is my ideal.\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF is my love!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "msgctxt": "501680",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Everyone…\nEveryone picked on me.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "msgctxt": "501784",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "But, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF was different.\nWhenever I cried, #[he][she]# lent me a gentle hand.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "msgctxt": "502232",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Aah…! Aaaugh!\nAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "msgctxt": "502384",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Please don't hurt me.\nNot you too…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "msgctxt": "502428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You made me… want your kindness,\nand I like you now because of it.\nSo… don't turn me away.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "msgctxt": "502524",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I can't take it any more.\nYou'll never get away with this!\nNever, never, NEVER!!!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "msgctxt": "503004",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "As if driving herself to the edge,\nshe repeats her monologue of pent-up emotion.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "msgctxt": "503208",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "While listening to #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's lamentations,\nwe sink deeper into its midst.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "msgctxt": "503360",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I need my resolve.\nLet this childish #C000246204Ego#CDEF meet my blade――!",
      "pt": ""
    },
