      "pt": "sem salvar os Clear Data?"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "msgctxt": "517224",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The void we're descending into is dark,\nbut somewhat warm.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "msgctxt": "517284",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "The twirling pattern seemed to be of flower petals.\nImages of flowers which could calm the mood of anyone\nwho sees them―the polar opposite to #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's brutal claws.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "msgctxt": "517472",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I don't like fighting.\nI don't like being scared.\nI don't want to get hurt anymore…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "msgctxt": "517560",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Please have fun talks with me.\nPlease show me a pretty world.\nPlease touch me, with gentle motions.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "msgctxt": "517660",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "If you could, don't chase after me.\nEveryone is so weak and frail.\nI just touch them once, and SMOOSH they go.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "msgctxt": "517772",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…hrm. Hearing this voice of hers makes her\nsound like a delicate young girl, but…\nThat last phrase is a little disturbing.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "msgctxt": "517900",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Does #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF not understand?\nIt's not that the world is fragile,\nit's that she has too much strength.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "msgctxt": "518024",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Her delicate, naive voice makes you want to\npity her, but… if you hear it too many times,\nit WILL start sounding like a curse.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "msgctxt": "518152",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She breaks things she touches―things she loves\nnot because they're frail; it's because her\nclaws are far too brutal.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "msgctxt": "518272",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Huh? I look like I'm in a very foul mood?\nNot at all.\nThis is simply hatred towards my own kind.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "msgctxt": "518372",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This woman honestly thinks that if she endures,\neverything will turn out fine. As if we can't\nsee what's actually wrong here.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "msgctxt": "518500",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "When you end up destroying all that you touch,\nit just means that you're strange to the world.\nHer mistake is not accepting that fact.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "msgctxt": "518636",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I see, at last I comprehend―as to why her\npersonality heaps mountains of corpses.\nI've cleared away all doubt, mongrel.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "msgctxt": "518760",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "She grieves of how fragile the world is,\nbut with those claws, she rends all that\nshe touches.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "msgctxt": "518856",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "All along, that #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF was a lethal weapon\nwho was loathed by the world. She must\nbe the only one who can't realize that.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "msgctxt": "519000",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Please help me…\nWhen everyone sees me, their eyes bulge\nand their hands go up in the air.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "msgctxt": "519092",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Please forgive me…\nEveryone, EVERYONE,\nthey laugh at me, saying I'm bad.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "msgctxt": "519168",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#[He][She]# HAS to be different from the others.\n#[He][She]# looked at me with kindness.\n#[He][She]# spoke to me with a soft voice.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "msgctxt": "519300",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "So kindly――!\nAnd, with a kind smile, like the one I saw over\nand over in my dreams, #[he][she]# asked me my name.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "msgctxt": "519416",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I love #[him][her]#… I love #[him][her]#…\nI love #[him][her]#… I love #[him][her]#…\nI love #[him][her]#… I love #[him][her]#…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "msgctxt": "519552",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I knew it before we met.\nI loved #[him][her]# before we met.\nBut, once we finally did…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "msgctxt": "519640",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I really, REALLY came to love #[him][her]#!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "msgctxt": "519684",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "My dream, the one I could only\nsee in my sleep, came true.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "msgctxt": "519744",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Yes, I love #[him][her]#,\nI love #[him][her]#,\nI love #[him][her]#…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "msgctxt": "519816",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Way, WAY more than anyone else, so much so that\nI'll pulverize anyone who comes between us――\nThat's how much I love #[him][her]#!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "msgctxt": "519948",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…pardon me, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nTechnically, I should be laughing off these\nrash remarks, calling them absurd, yet…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "msgctxt": "520080",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I cannot shame this voice―this love that wilts,\nlest it steals everything from its other.\nThat's how love felt for me as well.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "msgctxt": "520208",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…that said, we need to defeat her.\nOne's love in such a form will only burn\ntheir lovers to ash. I know that all too well.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "msgctxt": "520332",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Don't get distracted, Master.\nHer displays of affection and kindness are no\nindication that she's on your side.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "msgctxt": "520444",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This confession is a choice, \"one\" or \"zero.\"\nDevote your all or she'll kill your all. Hers is\na cruel goddess' love of absolute portrayal.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "msgctxt": "520584",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Only, YOU'RE getting pulverized. I might be one\nto talk when sizing up others, but as her\nprecursor, I'll say this much:",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "msgctxt": "520708",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This one has way too much #ROFS-002#RUBS  baggage#RUBEpassion#REND for my tastes.\nShe should come back after shaving a few #ROFS-001#RUBS  cups#RUBEclaws#REND.\nMaybe then she'll develop a proper spine.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "msgctxt": "520912",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Ha! Quite the passionate confession, no?\nCharmed her down to the very bone, lady-killer.\nDid you two hit it off in secret earlier?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "msgctxt": "521044",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Alas, what awaits you now is no bed,\nbut a battlefield. Do you have what it takes\nto judge the one who pines for you?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "msgctxt": "521164",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "They would laugh and say, \"You're a monster.\"\n\"You're just a filthy animal!\"",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "msgctxt": "521244",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "That's why #[he][she]# is my Prince Charming.\nI just know #[he][she]#'ll be kind to me…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "msgctxt": "521336",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I just know it.\nFor one, #[he][she]# would come to me with\na flower that I like very much.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "msgctxt": "521428",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Then #[he][she]# would get close and tell me not to cry;\n#[he][she]# would wipe my tears, holding out the\nflower… Then, #[he][she]# would take my hand, and…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "msgctxt": "521588",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "…then, #[he][she]# would take my…!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "msgctxt": "521628",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#[He][She]# wouldn't take my hand.\n#[He][She]# wouldn't hold my hand.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "msgctxt": "521700",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "#[He][She]# looked at me like I was someone scary,\nsomeone unpleasant, someone #[he][she]# hates.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "msgctxt": "521800",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I still really like you, though.\nI still love you, though!\nSo――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "msgctxt": "521868",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Even if I die, even if you kill me,\neven if I'm hated all over for it,\nI'll NEVER let you get away!",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "msgctxt": "521968",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "You're my Prince and mine alone.\nI promise you this:\nI'll take good care of you. Forever…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "msgctxt": "522060",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "Wouldn't you like to #ROFS0003#RUBS die#RUBElive#REND on forever,\nsafe inside of my #ROFS-001#RUBStrash bin#RUBEchest#REND?",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "msgctxt": "522184",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I won't let anyone come between us anymore.\nI won't let anyone else have you――",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "msgctxt": "522268",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I really like you. I really like you.\nI really like you. I really like you.\nI really like you. I really like you…",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "msgctxt": "522384",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "I can't tell if her subconscious voice\nsings the ode of an earnest love\nor the dirge of an obsessive mental break.",
      "pt": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "msgctxt": "522500",
      "tipo": "backlog,motion,text",
      "medida": "dialog",
      "max_bytes": null,
      "comum": false,
      "repeticoes": 1,
      "en": "This course must be coming to an end soon.",
      "pt": ""
    }
  ]
}
